2️⃣ THE MASTER PATTERN TABLE 🔥

Problem clue	Pattern

Sorted array + pair	Two Pointers
Subarray + sum	Prefix Sum / Sliding Window
Longest/shortest contiguous segment	Sliding Window
Search in sorted data	Binary Search
Next greater/smaller	Monotonic Stack
Top K	Heap
Kth largest/smallest	Heap
Take/Don't Take	DP
Generate all possibilities	Backtracking
Shortest unweighted path	BFS
Shortest weighted path	Dijkstra
Dependencies	Topological Sort
Connected components	DFS/BFS
