1️⃣3️⃣ BINARY SEARCH ON ANSWER 🔥

This is a higher-level pattern.

Sometimes you're not searching for an element.

You're searching for:

> The minimum/maximum possible answer.



Examples:

Minimum capacity

Minimum eating speed

Maximum minimum distance

Minimum time


Pattern:

Possible answer range
        ↓
Binary Search
        ↓
Check feasibility

This is extremely useful in interviews.


